    "ja": {
      "trackName": "The Knight Watch",
      "description": "Stomp your enemies and solve tricky levels in The Knight Watch, a unique puzzle game for iPhone AND Apple Watch.\n\n\"A refreshing modern twist on the most familiar game of them all.\" - Pocket Gamer\n\n\"Knight Watch is puzzle game full of surprises, fun and adapted to all type of players.\" - Kickmygeek\n\n\"The Knight Watch‘s novel use of Chess rules and its welcoming nature manage to get it out of check\" - Loud Games\n\nYou are a lone knight who can only move in L-shape (as in chess). The goal is simple : clear all levels by capturing all of the pieces. \n\nExplore the 100 levels and 2 game modes and overcome units inspired by chess pieces (Rook, Bishop, Queen…) and tricky obstacles. \n\n* Pay once and play forever! Events and monthly content are on the way...\n\n* 30 skins to unlock; change the visuals to match your mood.\n\n* Apple Watch friendly: adapted gameplay, 100 unique levels, daily missions and 1 specific game mode.\n\n* Complications for Apple Watch and 15+ stickers for iMessage.\n\n* Beautiful and stylish visuals.\n\n* The perfect puzzle game: quick, fun and immersive gameplay!\n\n\nLove The Knight Watch? Follow us to get exclusive skins.\nFollow us on Twitter: @KnightWatch_\nLike us on Facebook: facebook.com/seelegames\nOr come talk to us on Discord: https://discord.gg/5NGrEkp\n\n\nDEVELOPER\nSeele games is a company specialized in iPhone and AppleWatch games. We make great games on small devices, with outside the box concepts, created with love, passion and generosity.\n\n\nThank you !\nhttp://seelegames.com/",
